{"code":"130740","name":"티피씨글로벌","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"자동차부품","sector_desc":"완성차에 들어가는 부품 제조. 완성차 생산량과 전동화(EV) 전환 속도, 환율의 영향을 받습니다.","desc":"동사는 1998년 인발튜브, 연료/냉각수 튜브 등 자동차 부품 제조판매 목적으로 설립되어 2011년 코스닥시장에 상장되었음. 자동차부품부문에서 정밀강관, 방진부품, 연료주입계통, 냉각계통 등을 제조하여 현대, 기아, GM, 르노삼성, 포드, 도요타, 닛산 등 글로벌 완성차 메이커에 공급하고 있음. 연결종속회사 (주)고리는 상수도, 하수도, 소방배관용 PVC배관을 제조판매하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-22","n_days":300,"close":1793.0,"open":1849.0,"high":1849.0,"low":1763.0,"volume":61185,"amount":109704705.0,"ret_1d":-5.9286,"gap":-2.9906,"range_pct":4.7964,"ret_5":-7.4342,"ret_20":-8.8923,"ret_60":-10.35,"ret_120":-16.4103,"ret_250":-13.3816,"ma20":1868.6,"ma60":1964.6833,"ma120":1985.85,"ma200":2045.14,"close_vs_ma200":-12.3287,"close_vs_ma60":-8.7385,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-26.1351,"r2_60":0.1502,"slope_120":-13.3184,"r2_120":0.1047,"slope_250":3.7913,"r2_250":0.0141,"high52":3495.0,"low52":1610.0,"pos_52w":9.7082,"dd_52w":-48.6981,"mdd_1y":-45.2564,"atr14_pct":7.099,"vol_ann_60":43.7635,"vol_avg20":53285.2,"vol_ratio20":1.1483,"vr5":0.9679,"vr20":0.3685,"amount_avg5":83885007.8,"amount_avg20":101888285.7,"amount_avg60":91455933.75,"obv_chg20":28.1132,"turnover_20":9.4505,"pv_eff_20":-0.9409,"rsi14":38.4147,"frgn_net_5":24375.0,"inst_net_5":16032.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.2162,"inst_net_5_pct":0.1422,"smart_net_5_pct":0.3583,"frgn_net_20":-36230.0,"inst_net_20":26077.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":-0.3213,"inst_net_20_pct":0.2312,"smart_net_20_pct":-0.09,"frgn_net_60":-88488.0,"inst_net_60":176148.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.7847,"inst_net_60_pct":1.5621,"smart_net_60_pct":0.7774,"frgn_net_120":-201212.0,"inst_net_120":1009265.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-1.7843,"inst_net_120_pct":8.95,"smart_net_120_pct":7.1657,"foreign_ratio":2.28,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.82,"smart_buy_streak":6,"op_income_q":6.0,"op_margin_q":3.125,"op_qoq":200.0,"op_turnaround":1.0,"op_yoy":500.0,"rev_yoy":11.6279,"op_trend_4q":72.9412,"fin_period":"202606","roe":22.37,"debt_ratio":34.42,"per":1.23,"pbr":0.23,"d